    {
      "source": "Helper method used to create a <a href=\"../PropertyValueConversions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConversions</code></a> instance with the configured\n<a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converters</code></a> provided by the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>callback</code></a>.",
