      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new ConverterConfiguration holding the given <a href=\"../CustomConversions.StoreConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.StoreConversions</code></a> and user defined converters as\nwell as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair</code></a> for which to skip the registration of default converters.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 ConverterConfiguration，其中包含给定的 <a href=\"../CustomConversions.StoreConversions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions.StoreConversions</code></a> 以及用户定义的转换器，同时包含一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>，该集合中存放了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>GenericConverter.ConvertiblePair</code></a>，用于跳过这些对的默认转换器注册。",
